<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets 1.0 billion FRF FRN/fixed bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets 1.0 billion FRF FRN/fixed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Commercial de France.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FRF   COUPON    *3M PIBOR  MATURITY    21.APR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    21.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.15	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ   *QUARTERLY</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMS FR/DE/US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.025     SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *PAYS 4.00 PERCENT ANNUAL COUPON IN SECOND YEAR.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
